---
import {ArrowUpRight} from 'lucide-react';
---
<section class="inquiry-section section" id="inquiry"><div class="wrap inquiry-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</span><h2>Have a drawing?<br/>Let's review it.</h2><p>Tell us the material and quantity you need. We will review the part requirements with you before quoting.</p><p class="nda"><strong>Need an NDA?</strong> Contact LZZ before sharing confidential drawings.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/ordering/rfq-checklist/">RFQ checklist <ArrowUpRight size={18}/></a></div><form class="demo-form"><p class="demo-note">Preview only — nothing is sent or saved. Use sample text.</p><label for="part">Part or drawing reference <span>(required)</span></label><input id="part" name="part" required placeholder="e.g. Pump housing — revision B"/><div class="form-pair"><div><label for="material">Material</label><input id="material" name="material" placeholder="Grade, or to discuss"/></div><div><label for="quantity">Quantity</label><input id="quantity" name="quantity" placeholder="e.g. 20 pieces"/></div></div><label for="requirements">Requirements</label><textarea id="requirements" name="requirements" rows="3" placeholder="Finish, critical features, inspection records and delivery destination"></textarea><button class="button" type="submit">Preview RFQ summary <ArrowUpRight size={19}/></button><p class="form-help">On the current website, prepare an email draft, attach your files in your email app, then send it to LZZ.</p><div class="draft" hidden role="status"><h3>Your sample inquiry</h3><pre></pre><p>This is a local demonstration. No message has been sent.</p><a href="/quote/">Continue to the current inquiry page <ArrowUpRight size={16}/></a></div></form></div></section>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('.demo-form')!;
form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const data=new FormData(form);const result=form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.draft')!;result.querySelector('pre')!.textContent=['Part: '+data.get('part'),'Material: '+(data.get('material')||'To discuss'),'Quantity: '+(data.get('quantity')||'To confirm'),'Requirements: '+(data.get('requirements')||'To discuss')].join('\n');result.hidden=false;});
</script>
